OL,3,GNEWSANo successful asylum claims in
OL,4,Apast five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of five people have applied for
OL,7,Fasylum in the island during the past
OL,8,Ffive years and all were refused, the
OL,9,Fhome affairs minister has said.
OL,11,FSenator Helen Miles said the asylum
OL,12,Fclaims had been processed by the Jersey
OL,13,FCustoms and Immigration Service.
OL,15,FResponding to a question about
OL,16,Fimmigration from deputy Montfort
OL,17,FTadier, Miles said all five claimants
OL,18,Fhad been returned to "a safe third
OL,19,Fcountry".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
