OL,3,GNEWSANo successful asylum claims in
OL,4,Apast five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island's immigration law states
OL,7,Fpeople claiming asylum have a screening
OL,8,Finterview, have no recourse to public
OL,9,Ffunds and are not permitted to
OL,10,Fundertake employment while their claim
OL,11,Fis considered.
